username = "envienna"
rating = 0.5
review_content = "I used to spend whole afternoons here reading books and comics while the owner refilled everyone’s coffee for free. They remembered your name, your usual order, even your birthday. 

Now they ripped out every bookshelf to make room for those machines. 

Funny thing is… the coffee still isn’t any faster.
"
